WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:11.939
Any lesson plan can become slides for the projector. In Materials, tap Make lesson slides.

2
00:00:11.939 --> 00:00:17.311
Choose a look. You can change it later.

3
00:00:17.311 --> 00:00:26.988
Consilia makes the whole deck from your plan: goals, key words, the target sentence, every activity, questions and an exit ticket.

4
00:00:26.988 --> 00:00:36.364
Tap a slide to change its words. Your teacher notes go with every slide.

5
00:00:36.364 --> 00:00:56.370
Press Present. Use the arrow keys or a clicker. A question shows its answer on the next press.

6
00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:00.993
In Teach mode, the Slides tool opens them at the stage you are teaching.

7
00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:12.319
Download PowerPoint to open it in PowerPoint, or import it into Canva or Google Slides to add pictures.

8
00:01:12.319 --> 00:01:23.953
Want a reading text, a dialogue or more questions? Copy the prompt to any AI, or turn on Cloud AI in Me with your own free Gemini key.

9
00:01:23.953 --> 00:01:29.236
AI slides are marked AI, so you check them before class. Next: watch "Classes and PBD".
